<%- include('partials/top') %>
<div class="wrap narrow doc">
  <h1>Seller terms</h1>
  <p class="muted">These terms apply to everyone who sells on EasyNotes, an independent South African business. Questions? Email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>

  <h2>Eligibility and verification</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must have completed a degree at a recognised institution and provide your degree certificate or academic transcript and your ID.</li>
    <li>We may approve, decline or withdraw verification at our discretion. If verification is withdrawn, your notes are hidden from sale.</li>
    <li>The degree and institution shown on your storefront must be accurate.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You confirm that you wrote the notes and own the rights to sell them.</li>
    <li>Notes must not contain copyrighted material from others, including textbooks, lecturer slides, study guides, past exam papers, tests or memoranda from any institution.</li>
    <li>Notes must be PDF files and must match their title and description.</li>
    <li>We may remove any listing that we believe breaks these terms, without notice.</li>
    <li>You give EasyNotes a licence to host, display your listing, and deliver your files to buyers. You keep ownership of your notes.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Fees and payouts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>EasyNotes keeps <%= feePercent %>% of each sale price as its platform fee. You receive the rest.</li>
    <li>Payments are split by Paystack at the time of sale. Your share is settled to the bank account you provide, on Paystack’s settlement schedule.</li>
    <li>You are responsible for declaring your earnings to SARS.</li>
    <li>Sales are final for buyers. If we refund a buyer because a file was defective or misdescribed, the refunded amount may be recovered from future payouts.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>After you stop selling</h2>
  <p>If you unpublish notes, students who already bought them can still download them.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/bottom') %>
